<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>听不懂 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E5%90%AC%E4%B8%8D%E6%87%82/</link><description>Recent content in 听不懂 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:31:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E5%90%AC%E4%B8%8D%E6%87%82/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>听不懂时怎么救场</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/life/clarification/</link><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 23:20:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/life/clarification/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;你现在的英语，&lt;strong&gt;能听懂的比例远高于能说出的比例&lt;/strong&gt;。真正让你卡住的，几乎都不是&amp;quot;不知道该怎么说&amp;quot;，而是：对方说了一大段，你没跟上，又不好意思打断，于是整句话就废了——接下来只能点头微笑，然后彻底掉线。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>